MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_001: Hey. I hear you used to be a bandit. We haven't met\nbefore, have we? Before the games, I mean.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_002: Huh?! Nah, don't think so.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_003: No? Then what's your problem?
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_004: Hey, you came up to me. Aren't you, uh,\nSimon, the Sky-Drum or whatever?
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_005: The mighty mercenary who's crossed countless\nbattlefields. Everybody knows who you are.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_006: If we met in battle, I think I'd remember. And that's\nassuming I would've survived at all.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_007: I mean, you're not someone people forget. Point is I\ndon't know who you're thinking of, but it's not me.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_008: Hm. You just look awfully familiar. My mistake.\nAll the faces start blurring together at some point.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_009: I've fought off more bandits than I can count...\nI guess I mistook you for one of them.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_010: Yeah, that's gotta be it. What was it you wanted\nfrom me anyway?
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_011: Given my past, there are people who'd like to see me\ndead. Figured I'd make sure you weren't one of 'em.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_012: And nip any trouble in the bud if need be.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_013: Ack!
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_014: Glad I checked! I'd feel terrible if I had killed you\njust because you look like someone else.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_015: Yeah, good thing. Reaaally good thing. Hehe...\nHehehe...
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_016: Anyway, sorry for takin' up your time. I'll see\nya around!
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_017: What the hell? He thinks he can just threaten me like\nthat, and for what? Nothing. A mistake!
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_018: Don't underestimate me, drum boy. You won't be\nlucky enough to see another sunrise!
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_019: Hm? Oh, was there something else?
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_020: Nah, nope. All good here. Hehe... Heh...
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_021: I, uh, just remembered I gotta do a thing. I'll see ya.
MID_SE_Sim_Zac_C_022: {SetColor=Gray}I'll let it slide this time... Dealing with his sort\ntends to be more trouble than it's worth.{SetColor=Default}